e Lighthouse</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Price\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Price</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">$50</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Speed\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Speed</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">54-55 Stud/s (Base on when it bump)</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Version Added\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">v1.0.0</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">January 14th, 2023</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Status\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Available</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><br />\n</p>\n<blockquote><p>\"It may be missing a few bolts and be slightly unsafe for driving, but it'll get you to where you need to go (slowly).\" -The ingame description.</p></blockquote>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span></h2>\n<p>The <b>Rusty Putter</b> is a vehicle that can be bought at <a href=\"/wiki/Lighthouse\" title=\"Lighthouse\">The Lighthouse</a> for $50. \n</p><p>It used to be the beginner vehicle when starting the game until it was replaced by the <a href=\"/wiki/Rusty_Joop_Barrow\" title=\"Rusty Joop Barrow\">Rusty Joop Barrow</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span></h2>\n<ul><li>This is the cheapest vehicle that can be bought ingame.</li>\n<li>It is also the slowest, bumpiest (unstable) vehicle in the game and has the least usable storage.</li>\n<li>This vehicle can be often buggy.</li>\n<li>Unless you lose your starter vehicle, there is absolutely no reason to use this vehicle for everyday use unless you want to suffer.</li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260903004926\nCache expiry: 1209600\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.033 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.061 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 70/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 67/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 6/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.006/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1019475/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   35.176      1 Template:Vehicles\n100.00%   35.176      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_oaklands:pcache:idhash:245-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260903004926 and revision id 21180. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>","categories":["Vehicles"],"links":[{"title":"Lighthouse","exists":true},{"title":"Rusty Joop Barrow","exists":true}],"images":["Rusty-Putter-UNBOXED-V109.0.png","Rusty-Putter-UNBOXED.png","Rusty-Putter-BOXED.png"]}
